-- A note exists in all four languages or it does not exist. Standing,
-- not point-in-time: the defect this migration repairs was a tool
-- writing cards without notes, and the next one will be a tool writing
-- a note in English only. Migration 608 is the precedent for getting
-- this choice wrong -- exactly the right claim, declared point-in-time,
-- and a country could then ship past it while the replay printed OK.
-- ASSERT ALWAYS: SELECT count(*) FROM (SELECT t.card_id FROM deep_dive_card_translations t JOIN deep_dive_cards d ON d.id = t.card_id WHERE d.section = 'file_format' AND t.note IS NOT NULL AND t.note <> '' GROUP BY t.card_id HAVING count(*) <> 4) = 0
